# OpenSpec regenerates its slash commands as a second set of skills under a
# `source-command-` prefix on unrelated invocations (seen on `openspec
# archive`). They duplicate the committed `openspec-*` skills, are derived from
# the gitignored .claude/commands/opsx/, and break the vendored-skills,
# caps and markdownlint globs. Keep them out of the tree.
.agents/skills/source-command-*/
tmp/
local-test-data/

# Coverage data written by the full set and CI
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
